  "description": "Change of use from showroom/garage (Sui Generis) to&nbsp;workshop&nbsp;(Class E(g)(iii)), together with installation of a boundary fence.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed boundary treatment is considered to represent an excessively high fence, which results in an unnecessary hardening of the streetscene on its prominent corner position. This is considered harmful to visual amenity and is contrary to the design objectives of Policy 53 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of information regarding the delivery and servicing of the proposed Class E unit, the Local Planning Authority is unable to fully understand the likely effects upon users of the public highway and the overall transport impacts of the development. Therefore it is unconfirmed whether the proposal complies with the objectives of Policies 60 and 63 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
